        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 23 at 4:56PM HST until September 26 at 6:00PM HST by NWS Honolulu HI</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 25 to 40 kt with higher gusts and seas 6
to 9 feet.

* WHERE...Maalaea Bay and Pailolo Channel.

* WHEN...Until 6 PM HST Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in these conditions.</instruction>
